Description: Transitional package — mmpm folded into secubox-magicmirror
 The MagicMirror Package Manager API and frontend now live inside
 secubox-magicmirror (>= 1.1), reachable at /magicmirror/mmpm/ and
 /api/v1/magicmirror/mmpm/* respectively. This package ships no
 files. Safe to apt-get autoremove after upgrade.
